Git Fetch

Suppose another developer pushes new commits.

Your local repository doesn't know about them.

Run:

git fetch

Git downloads the latest changes without modifying your working files.

GitHub
    │
    ▼
Local Repository

No merge happens yet.

Git Pull
git pull

This performs:

git fetch

+

git merge

Your working directory is updated with the latest changes.

Fetch vs Pull
git fetch	git pull
Downloads changes	Downloads and merges
Safe	Changes working directory
No merge	Merge happens automatically
